00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:40.527
All right. Bye, Clodio.


00:04:41.028 --> 00:04:43.297
Goodbye, my love.


00:04:43.299 --> 00:04:44.958
You're not mad at me?
You're going to tell my dad?


00:04:44.994 --> 00:04:46.489
Let's go.


00:04:46.525 --> 00:04:47.692
