<i> of an eccentric</i>


01:40:20.627 --> 01:40:23.357
<i> mad scientist</i>
<i> that could kill us all?</i>


01:40:23.392 --> 01:40:25.063
HOST:<i> On</i> Crosstalk.


01:40:25.132 --> 01:40:26.797
MAN 1:<i> Megalon is</i>
<i> from outer space.</i>


01:40:26.833 --> 01:40:28.131
